  "updated_at": "2026-04-02",
  "bio": "Raul Cuadrado is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in newschool, illustrative, and neotraditional styles. He brings his unique flair to each design and has honed his craft to the highest level. You can marvel at his artistry in person at Union Tattoos in Zaragoza, Spain or at DeMontattoo Estudio in Lerida, Spain, where his prowess with the needle shines through in every vibrant, detailed piece he creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Zaragoza, Aragon, Spain"
}
